Adds a TOP-PRIORITY MANDATORY-NEXT-MILESTONE entry: run the GAP-4 execution-
consistency primitive (induce program from demos -> restricted-namespace exec ->
exact-output-match demo-fit selection) on a NON-ARC code-synthesis corpus
